§ `Section 7(1) -- where it has effect`

#ASSERT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `Division 4 of Part 4`
#ASSERT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `section 163`
#ASSERT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `section 164`
#ASSERT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `section 165`
#ASSERT NOT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `section 244`
#ASSERT NOT `section 7 as a whole has effect for this provision` `some other provision`

-- Only subsection (6A) reaches section 244.
#ASSERT `subsection (6A) has effect for this provision` `section 244`
#ASSERT `subsection (6A) has effect for this provision` `section 163`
#ASSERT NOT `subsection (6A) has effect for this provision` `some other provision`

§ `Section 7(1A), (2), (3), (6), (6A), (9) -- a person's own interest`

#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority only`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `knowledge of an interest under a trust`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `a contract to purchase`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `a right to have a share transferred`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `an option`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `entitled to exercise a right attached to someone else's share`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `a book-entry security`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `no limb at all`

-- Joint holding is not a limb, and does not defeat one.
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `joint holding and nothing else`
#ASSERT NOT `holding jointly with another person prevents an interest`
#ASSERT NOT `being unable to relate the interest to a particular share prevents an interest`

-- s 7(3): a collective investment scheme unit is not an interest in a share, whatever else
-- the holder has.
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority, as the holder of a collective investment scheme unit`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `an option, as the holder of a collective investment scheme unit`

-- s 7(9): the five disregards.
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority, as a bare trustee`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority, as a lender holding security`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority, by reason of a prescribed office`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority over the company's own shares bought under section 76B`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority, a prescribed interest to be disregarded`

-- s 7(6A) treats a book-entry security as an interest, and s 7(9)(a) disregards the
-- bare trustee's interest. Combining them: the bare trustee's book-entry holding is
-- disregarded.
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `a book-entry security held as bare trustee`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `knowledge of a trust interest, held as lender's security`

-- s 7(7), (8), (10): joint holding, unrelatedness, remoteness and restraint are all
-- immaterial. The interest stays.
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `authority that is joint, unrelated to a particular share, remote and restrained`
#ASSERT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `every limb and no disregard`
#ASSERT NOT `the person has an interest in the shares on its own account` `every limb and every disregard`

#ASSERT `the interest is within a limb of section 7 that gives an interest` `every limb and every disregard`
#ASSERT `the interest is disregarded under section 7(9)` `every limb and every disregard`
#ASSERT NOT `the interest is disregarded under section 7(9)` `every limb and no disregard`

§ `Fixtures -- associates and tiers`

GIVEN `how` IS A HowAssociated, `percentage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN Associate
DECIDE `an associate` `how` `percentage` IS
    Associate WITH
        `how associated` IS `how`
        `voting power in the body corporate, as a percentage` IS `percentage`

`a subsidiary holding 12%` MEANS `an associate` `a subsidiary of the person` 12
`a person who follows the instructions holding 8%` MEANS `an associate` `a person accustomed or obliged to act on the person's wishes in relation to the share` 8
`a controlled company holding 5%` MEANS `an associate` `a body corporate, or one whose majority of directors are, so accustomed or obliged` 5
`an unconnected holder of 50%` MEANS `an associate` `not an associate within section 7(5)` 50

GIVEN `accustomed` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `controlling interest` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `own percentage` IS A NUMBER,
      `associates` IS A LIST OF Associate
GIVETH A Tier
DECIDE `a tier` `accustomed` `controlling interest` `own percentage` `associates` IS
    Tier WITH
        `the body corporate or its directors are accustomed or obliged to act on this person's directions, instructions or wishes` IS `accustomed`
        `this person has a controlling interest in the body corporate` IS `controlling interest`
        `the voting power this person is entitled to exercise or control, as a percentage` IS `own percentage`
        `the associates of this person` IS `associates`

`exactly 20%` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 20 EMPTY
`19.9%` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 19.9 EMPTY
`10% plus a subsidiary's 12%` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 10 (LIST `a subsidiary holding 12%`)
`10% plus an unconnected 50%` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 10 (LIST `an unconnected holder of 50%`)
`nothing but accustomed to act on the person's wishes` MEANS `a tier` TRUE FALSE 0 EMPTY
`nothing but a controlling interest` MEANS `a tier` FALSE TRUE 0 EMPTY
`no voting power and no control` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 0 EMPTY
`associates alone make 25%` MEANS `a tier` FALSE FALSE 0 (LIST `a subsidiary holding 12%`, `a person who follows the instructions holding 8%`, `a controlled company holding 5%`)

§ `Section 7(5) -- associates`

#ASSERT `the voting power the associates control` (LIST `a subsidiary holding 12%`, `a person who follows the instructions holding 8%`) EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the voting power the associates control` (LIST `a subsidiary holding 12%`, `a person who follows the instructions holding 8%`, `a controlled company holding 5%`) EQUALS 25

-- A holder who is not an associate within s 7(5) contributes nothing, however large.
#ASSERT `the voting power the associates control` (LIST `an unconnected holder of 50%`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the voting power the associates control` EMPTY EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the voting power the person and the person's associates control together` `10% plus a subsidiary's 12%` EQUALS 22
#ASSERT `the voting power the person and the person's associates control together` `10% plus an unconnected 50%` EQUALS 10

§ `Section 7(4) and (4A) -- one tier`

-- "Not less than 20%": exactly 20 is in, 19.9 is out.
#ASSERT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `exactly 20%`
#ASSERT NOT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `19.9%`

-- (4A)(c): the person and the associates together.
#ASSERT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `10% plus a subsidiary's 12%`
#ASSERT NOT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `10% plus an unconnected 50%`

-- (4A)(b): the associates alone.
#ASSERT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `associates alone make 25%`

-- (4)(a) and (b) need no percentage at all.
#ASSERT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `nothing but accustomed to act on the person's wishes`
#ASSERT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `nothing but a controlling interest`
#ASSERT NOT `this tier passes the interest upwards` `no voting power and no control`

§ `Section 7(4) and (4A) -- a chain of tiers`

-- A person who is the holder has the interest with no tiers above.
#ASSERT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` EMPTY

-- One tier above.
#ASSERT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `exactly 20%`)
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `19.9%`)

-- THE LOOK-THROUGH. Three tiers of exactly 20% each: the economic stake is 0.8%, and the
-- person at the top is deemed to have an interest in the shares. The threshold is
-- tested tier by tier and is not compounded along the chain.
#ASSERT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `exactly 20%`, `exactly 20%`, `exactly 20%`)

-- One tier short anywhere in the chain and the interest stops.
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `exactly 20%`, `19.9%`, `exactly 20%`)
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `19.9%`, `exactly 20%`, `exactly 20%`)
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `exactly 20%`, `exactly 20%`, `19.9%`)

-- A mixed chain: control of the board in one tier, voting power in another.
#ASSERT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority only` (LIST `nothing but a controlling interest`, `exactly 20%`, `nothing but accustomed to act on the person's wishes`)

-- A bottom-tier interest that s 7(9) disregards passes nothing up, however much voting
-- power sits above it.
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority, as a bare trustee` (LIST `exactly 20%`)
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `authority, as the holder of a collective investment scheme unit` (LIST `exactly 20%`)
#ASSERT NOT `the person at the top of the chain has an interest in the shares` `no limb at all` (LIST `exactly 20%`)
